{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trivia Deal is the world\u2019s first trivia roguelike.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer fast. Play smart. Use lifelines, swap cards, and relics to survive the Rainbow Reaper. Each run is unforgiving, one wrong answer can end it all. High-stakes strategy with random questions, categories, and rewards that keep every run fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0248d6d1b40fae2567bb848fe8f01000.poster.avif?t=1768796387\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0248d6d1b40fae2567bb848fe8f01000.webm?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0248d6d1b40fae2567bb848fe8f01000.mp4?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build Your Trivia Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Choose your path through randomised columns, optimising for well timed reward chests and categories you know best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/bbe1db78def4a9cc4945202032d9c9db.poster.avif?t=1768796387\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/bbe1db78def4a9cc4945202032d9c9db.webm?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/bbe1db78def4a9cc4945202032d9c9db.mp4?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Purchase Unique Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, spend earned gold on lifelines, relics, and swap cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/200cde50008cccd7b78458b6be37cc8a.poster.avif?t=1768796387\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/200cde50008cccd7b78458b6be37cc8a.webm?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/200cde50008cccd7b78458b6be37cc8a.mp4?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Combine Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use lifelines like 50/50, Frenzy, and Double Dicey. Stack lifelines for big rewards, or massive fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/2ec48a0e22856fd5c1feac4a605e238d.poster.avif?t=1768796387\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/2ec48a0e22856fd5c1feac4a605e238d.webm?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/2ec48a0e22856fd5c1feac4a605e238d.mp4?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Swap the Odds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always get stuck with that one topic? Use a Swap Card to trade unwanted trivia for something you actually know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/562b2b031e257422a4306d7fec78e399.poster.avif?t=1768796387\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/562b2b031e257422a4306d7fec78e399.webm?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/562b2b031e257422a4306d7fec78e399.mp4?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Defeat the Reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Rainbow Reaper in twisted boss rounds that test more than just your trivia knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,000+ multiple choice questions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 trivia categories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 lifeline abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ swap packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 levels to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820760?t=1768796387","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768796387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/26a5632320aaa7ac492cddda446094857c743a0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768796387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/26a5632320aaa7ac492cddda446094857c743a0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768796387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2829590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trivia Deal is the world\u2019s first trivia roguelike.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer fast. Play smart. Use lifelines, swap cards, and relics to survive the Rainbow Reaper. Each run is unforgiving, one wrong answer can end it all. High-stakes strategy with random questions, categories, and rewards that keep every run fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0248d6d1b40fae2567bb848fe8f01000.poster.avif?t=1768796387\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0248d6d1b40fae2567bb848fe8f01000.webm?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/0248d6d1b40fae2567bb848fe8f01000.mp4?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build Your Trivia Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is unique. Choose your path through randomised columns, optimising for well timed reward chests and categories you know best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/bbe1db78def4a9cc4945202032d9c9db.poster.avif?t=1768796387\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/bbe1db78def4a9cc4945202032d9c9db.webm?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/bbe1db78def4a9cc4945202032d9c9db.mp4?t=1768796387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Purchase Unique Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between rounds, spend earned gold on lifelines, relics, and swap cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/200cde50008cccd7b78458b6be37cc8a.poster.avif?t=1768796387\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shar