/span>Defeat the Reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Rainbow Reaper in twisted boss rounds that test more than just your trivia knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,000+ multiple choice questions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 trivia categories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 lifeline abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ swap packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 levels to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fluent Pixel"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/a1eb1766d8aa98dca9e718814d3eb89998b2f875/header.jpg?t=1768796387","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2820760/658291/29456db15b21ca6a51d515604dc13fbbe07c452b/1750944567/dash_av1.mpd?t=1731583323","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2820760/658291/29456db15b21ca6a51d515604dc13fbbe07c452b/1750944567/dash_h264.mpd?t=1731583323","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2820760/658291/29456db15b21ca6a51d515604dc13fbbe07c452b/1750944567/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1731583323","id":256998564,"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256998564/6185f036b1b333b60c5fdcbd2522fadc3c2bcf67/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1731583323"}],"name":"Trivia Deal","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct